  "description": "## Country card\nReusable slate/teal summary card for a caller-supplied normalized country. Uses Bellini box layouts, text nodes, badges, and a core button with an arrow icon. The optional flag is rendered as text only; no assets, API calls, or navigation are used.\n\n### Contract\n`country`: `{ code: string, name: string, native: string, emoji: string, capital: string, currency: string, phone: string, continentName: string, languages: string[] }`. Supply normalized values; the card does not invent or fetch country data and never mutates the object. Missing capital/currency display an em dash; missing flag, ISO, or continent are omitted.\n\n`onSelect({ country })` emits the supplied country through the `country` callback local when the details button is activated. The core button provides native keyboard activation; its surrounding focus-within ring makes keyboard focus visible. The card itself is not an interactive navigation target.",
  "modules": [],
  "name": "pw-country-card",
  "styles": [],
  "type": "custom-component",
  "variables": [
    {
      "body": "if ($ctrl.country && $ctrl.onSelect) {\n  $ctrl.onSelect({ country: $ctrl.country });\n}",
      "description": "Emits the supplied country without mutation or navigation.",
      "invokeOnLoad": false,
      "isAsync": false,
      "name": "selectCountry",
      "parameters": [],
      "returnType": {
        "name": "any"
      },
      "type": "method",
      "watch": []
    }
  ]
